{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13412","headline":"荆山独往 · 姚系","name":"荆山独往","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿昔山水上，抱琴独踯躅。\n山远去难穷，琴悲多断续。\n岩重丹阳树，泉咽闻阴谷。\n时下白云中，淹留秋水曲。\n秋水石栏深，潺湲如喷玉。\n杂芳被阴岸，坠露方消绿。\n恣此平生怀，独游还自足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}